    ## 2.4 game_players
    
    ### 역할
    
    - 결과 화면(역할/승패 공개) 및 통계용
    
    ### DDL
    
    ```sql
    CREATE TABLE game_players (
      id              UUID PRIMARY KEY,
      game_id         UUID NOT NULL REFERENCES games(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,
      room_player_id  UUID NOT NULL REFERENCES room_players(id) ON DELETE RESTRICT,
    
      role            TEXT NOT NULL,  -- 예: mawang_fear, slayer, coward ...
      team            TEXT NOT NULL,  -- good|evil
      side            TEXT NOT NULL,  -- hero|civil|evil|traitor
    
      result          TEXT,           -- win|lose (게임 종료 후 채움)
      died_at         TIMESTAMPTZ,
    
      created_at      TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now()
    );
    
    CREATE INDEX idx_game_players_game ON game_players(game_id);
    CREATE INDEX idx_game_players_room_player ON game_players(room_player_id);
    
    ```
    
    ---
    
    ## 2.5 game_events
    
    ### 역할
    
    - 디버깅/리플레이/분석
    - 플레이어별 로그 활용
    
    ### DDL
    
    ```sql
    CREATE TABLE game_events (
      id                UUID PRIMARY KEY,
      game_id           UUID NOT NULL REFERENCES games(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,
    
      seq               BIGINT NOT NULL,
      created_at        TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),
    
      event_type        TEXT NOT NULL,
      payload           JSONB NOT NULL,
    
      visibility        TEXT NOT NULL, -- public|team_good|team_evil|player_only
      target_player_id  UUID           -- player_only일 때 수신자(room_players.id)
    );
    
    CREATE UNIQUE INDEX uniq_game_events_seq ON game_events(game_id, seq);
    CREATE INDEX idx_game_events_game_time ON game_events(game_id, created_at DESC);
    
    ```
    
